00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:53.440
Yo, there's a, there's a research showing what makes a physician an effective diagnostician.

00:06:53.740 --> 00:06:57.460
and one of the markers is the number of words that the patient speaks

00:06:57.760 --> 00:07:02.800
compared to the number of words the physician speaks in the first 15 minutes of their interaction.

00:07:03.140 --> 00:07:07.920
and the more words the patient speaks the higher the diagnostic accuracy of the physician.

